			text = [=[Onyxia is a daughter of {link:deathwing}Deathwing{/link}, the Destroyer, and the twin of {red:nefarian}Nefarian{/red}, who rules the heights of {red:blackrock-spire}Blackrock Spire{/red}. She is the brood mother of the black dragonflight. From her lair beneath the {link:wyrmbog}Wyrmbog{/link} of {link:dustwallow-marsh}Dustwallow Marsh{/link} she raises a new generation of her father's kin. Her eggs cover the fens of the south, and whelps, drakes and dragonspawn serve her. She is vast, cunning and proud. Her breath is fire, and she looks upon mortals as prey. Those who have come uninvited into her lair she has greeted as a meal that spared her the trouble of the hunt.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Nefarian holds {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock Mountain{/link} and its orcs in the {link:eastern-kingdoms}Eastern Kingdoms{/link}. Onyxia holds the south of {link:dustwallow-marsh}Dustwallow Marsh{/link} in {link:kalimdor}Kalimdor{/link}, close to {link:theramore-isle}Theramore{/link} and to the lands of the {link:horde}Horde{/link}. Her brood drove the Stonemaul ogres from their home. Her own flight honours her: to stand guard over her is called an ascension. To the peoples of both continents she is a danger whose full reach none has yet measured.]=],
