			text = [=[For many years Onyxia wore a human face at the court of {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}. As {link:katrana-prestor}Lady Katrana Prestor{/link} she stood beside the regent, {link:bolvar-fordragon}Bolvar Fordragon{/link}, and through a medallion shaped from one of her own scales she held his mind captive. Then Marshal {red:reginald-windsor}Reginald Windsor{/red} escaped the prisons of {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock{/link} with his proof, and he came to the throne room to name her. She mocked him, called upon her guards and cast off her disguise. Windsor died there, but the spell was broken. Onyxia fled the city for her lair in the marsh. She left Bolvar the shattered medallion, and the knowledge that he had been her puppet.]=],
